From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rdkb-cli: make topology clients draggable and show moves

Place every client evenly on the inner perimeter of its authoritative SSID
bubble. Allow the operator to drag a client anywhere in the topology canvas
and cache the selected offset by MAC, owner and SSID so two-second signal
refreshes do not undo the presentation. Reset manual positions on Optimize
Layout or a real AP owner change.

Compare consecutive authoritative topology snapshots for STA owner changes.
Pulse a moved client and draw a directional purple trail from its former AP
that fades over six seconds. Manual diagram dragging changes presentation only
and cannot create a steering event.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [lab WebUI presentation]
